---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="GreenVillage - Beranda" activePage="home">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative h-[870px] flex items-center overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover" 
        alt="A panoramic wide-angle photograph of a lush, emerald-green Indonesian village nestled in a misty valley at dawn." 
        src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBiKmOT9fCF7j9lL9KM8c7tL8nZh-5J5bUWkMzfeMxbNSX6Xj-tJPISJquc0D0hJ7lqfLjqWrDYvgMUXUr7iaYP0jKP0jQDwL4ketlDDP5N73nBIONqqKsmeqh_hgm_72Hg-1ziye0CK5eZ5jJ4BjWNid80PtTI9B45qZPZqcBQ08tHvTbzsN7IWsNIzZfwwFRUZjPL-_jm5NrCISBQ68EcQ_FXq_DzNbfx_o_SkNGYHOaOiK6pgSFB7h9KyUtN-p9KrI9r7mvLmD4"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary/60 to-transparent"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-container-max mx-auto px-gutter w-full">
      <div class="max-w-2xl text-on-primary">
        <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1 bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container rounded-full font-label-md mb-6">
          Selamat Datang di GreenVillage
        </span>
        <h1 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl mb-6 leading-tight">Membangun Masa Depan Berbasis Nilai Tradisi.</h1>
        <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg mb-8 opacity-90">Kami berdedikasi untuk menciptakan lingkungan yang mandiri, inovatif, dan berkelanjutan bagi seluruh warga dan generasi mendatang.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href="/pemerintahan" class="bg-[#D4AF37] text-[#191c1d] px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-label-md hover:shadow-lg transition-all text-center">
            Jelajahi Desa
          </a>
          <a href="/layanan" class="border-2 border-on-primary text-on-primary px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-label-md hover:bg-on-primary/10 transition-all text-center">
            Layanan Publik
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Village Head Welcome -->
  <section class="py-section-padding-desktop bg-surface-bright">
    <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto px-gutter">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-16">
        <div class="w-full md:w-5/12 relative">
          <div class="absolute -top-4 -left-4 w-24 h-24 bg-primary-container rounded-2xl -z-10 opacity-20"></div>
          <img 
            class="w-full h-[500px] object-cover asymmetric-shape shadow-xl" 
            alt="Portrait of a village leader" 
            src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCIVznAlW8Ze5Kwi4FmAqA4zNIZiuNkumg7gQKUmJeuDQgA3SW4KlWJR9G_h3tiwmizfL2oKEv2YybW6u9J_UEVP6noUQaegyS11uZmgsLfmGOqqZIOQTQiZJQxqW9AYVWFI5w2coNFN5H9IbZmKqJU7HpHiYba0lZ_4aE_a5E10X8As8rz61EbnO4gVq_pCth_Bd8I-fG23lsxWsraGRNSi1NFycPQ1sN5tBJ3qlGdTNz8phtVF30jweA25C36RmisiCke6S4Krn8"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="w-full md:w-7/12">
          <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary mb-6">Sambutan Kepala Desa</h2>
          <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-[#D4AF37] mb-8"></div>
          <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant italic mb-8">
            "Keberhasilan pembangunan desa tidak hanya diukur dari infrastruktur fisik, tetapi dari seberapa besar masyarakatnya merasa terlibat dan diberdayakan. GreenVillage adalah rumah kita bersama, di mana inovasi teknologi bertemu dengan kearifan lokal."
          </p>
          <div class="mb-8">
            <h4 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary">Dr. Ir. Ahmad Subagyo</h4>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant opacity-70">Kepala Desa GreenVillage</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/pemerintahan" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-label-md group hover:underline">
            Lihat Struktur Kepemimpinan Selengkapnya &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Stats Section (Bento Grid) -->
  <section class="py-section-padding-desktop">
    <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto px-gutter">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <div class="md:col-span-2 bg-primary text-on-primary p-12 rounded-3xl flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden relative group">
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-8 opacity-20 transform translate-x-4 -translate-y-4 group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-500">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[120px]" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">groups</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg mb-2">3,450+</h3>
            <p class="font-body-lg opacity-80">Warga Terdaftar</p>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-8 font-body-md opacity-70">Pertumbuhan populasi yang stabil dengan dukungan fasilitas kesehatan dan pendidikan yang mumpuni.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container-high p-8 rounded-3xl flex flex-col justify-between border border-outline-variant">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-4xl mb-6">map</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary">450 Ha</h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant">Luas Wilayah</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-secondary text-on-secondary p-8 rounded-3xl flex flex-col justify-between">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-secondary text-4xl mb-6">workspace_premium</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md">12+</h3>
            <p class="opacity-80">Penghargaan Desa</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container p-8 rounded-3xl flex flex-col justify-between border border-outline-variant">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-4xl mb-6">eco</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary">85%</h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant">Energi Terbarukan</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-3 bg-surface-container-low p-8 rounded-3xl border border-outline-variant flex items-center justify-between">
          <div class="max-w-md">
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary mb-2">Desa Mandiri Energi 2024</h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md">Pencapaian terbaru kami dalam pengelolaan mikro-hidro dan panel surya komunal.</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/ekonomi" class="bg-primary text-on-primary w-12 h-12 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white">north_east</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Vision & Mission -->
  <section class="py-section-padding-desktop bg-primary-container text-on-primary relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 pointer-events-none">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-6 h-full w-full">
        <div class="border-r border-on-primary-container"></div>
        <div class="border-r border-on-primary-container"></div>
        <div class="border-r border-on-primary-container"></div>
        <div class="border-r border-on-primary-container"></div>
        <div class="border-r border-on-primary-container"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto px-gutter relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg mb-6">Visi &amp; Misi</h2>
        <p class="text-primary-fixed opacity-90 text-body-lg">Panduan strategis kami dalam mewujudkan GreenVillage sebagai pusat ekonomi kreatif dan kelestarian alam.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
        <div class="glass-effect p-10 rounded-[40px] text-primary">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-6 mb-8">
            <div class="bg-primary-container w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-primary text-3xl">visibility</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md">Visi Kami</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="font-body-lg leading-relaxed">"Menjadi desa digital percontohan nasional yang mandiri secara ekonomi, unggul dalam sumber daya manusia, dan tetap menjaga kelestarian ekosistem hutan tropis."</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md mb-8">Misi Kami</h3>
          <div class="flex gap-6 group">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-primary-fixed flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl group-hover:bg-primary-fixed group-hover:text-primary transition-all">01</div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-headline-md text-lg mb-2">Transformasi Digital</h4>
              <p class="text-primary-fixed opacity-70">Mengintegrasikan teknologi dalam setiap layanan administrasi dan edukasi masyarakat.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-6 group">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-primary-fixed flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl group-hover:bg-primary-fixed group-hover:text-primary transition-all">02</div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-headline-md text-lg mb-2">Ketahanan Pangan</h4>
              <p class="text-primary-fixed opacity-70">Meningkatkan produktivitas pertanian melalui teknik Smart Farming dan hidroponik.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-6 group">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-primary-fixed flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl group-hover:bg-primary-fixed group-hover:text-primary transition-all">03</div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-headline-md text-lg mb-2">Pemberdayaan UMKM</h4>
              <p class="text-primary-fixed opacity-70">Memberikan akses pasar global bagi produk kerajinan dan olahan pangan lokal.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script is:inline>
    // Hero scroll parallax effect
    window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
      const scrolled = window.pageYOffset;
      const heroImage = document.querySelector('section img');
      if (heroImage) {
        heroImage.style.transform = `translateY(${scrolled * 0.4}px)`;
      }
    });
  </script>
</Layout>
